.pnpm-store/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
android/.gradle/
android/**/build/
*.apk
!web/public/downloads/
!web/public/downloads/CPU-Web.apk
!web/public/downloads/CPU-Web-V*.apk

# desktop/build 不是构建产物，是打包用的输入：图标源图、NSIS 脚本、向导美术资源。
# 被上面的 build/ 一并挡掉过，结果是克隆下来根本打不出安装包。
!desktop/build/
desktop/release/
desktop/release-*/
!web/public/downloads/CPU-Web-Android-V*.apk
*.aab

